---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About Scott Smerchek - software engineer at UDisc based in Kansas City.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <article class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8">
        About me
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        My name is Scott Smerchek. I'm based in Kansas City and work for the remote-first company{' '}
        <a
          href="https://udisc.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline"
        >
          UDisc
        </a>, where I help build our web services (now with{' '}
        <a
          href="https://remix.run"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline"
        >
          Remix
        </a>) to grow the amazing game of disc golf.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        Outside of software, I enjoy disc golf, ultimate frisbee, hiking, constant learning, and reading epic fantasy—especially works by{' '}
        <a
          href="https://www.brandonsanderson.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline"
        >
          Brandon Sanderson
        </a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
